  <section class="ds-signup" id="signup"><span>UPDATES / DROP 001</span><h2>BE FIRST TO KNOW.</h2><p>Release information for DS-001.</p><form id="signup-form"><input id="signup-email" type="email" required placeholder="Email address" aria-label="Email address"/><button type="submit">JOIN ↗</button></form><div id="signup-message" role="status"></div><small>Email signup is not connected yet.</small></section>
</div>
</Base>